Project: Enterprise Data Management, Mapping & Analytics Dashboard
1. Project Overview

Build a complete, modern, enterprise-grade web application for managing, importing, visualizing, filtering, and analyzing structured mission-related datasets.

The application must be built using:

Frontend: React.js with TypeScript.
Backend: Node.js with Express.js and TypeScript.
Database: PostgreSQL.
ORM: Prisma.
Frontend styling: Tailwind CSS with shadcn/ui.
Charts: Apache ECharts or Recharts.
Maps: Leaflet with OpenStreetMap.
Data processing: ExcelJS and CSV Parser.
Authentication: JWT with secure session management.
Deployment: Docker and Docker Compose.
Reverse proxy: Nginx.

The application must be fully Dockerized, including the frontend, backend, PostgreSQL database, and Nginx.

The application should have a professional enterprise dashboard design, with a modern interface, responsive layouts, reusable components, and an intuitive navigation system.

All data operations must be restricted to authorized datasets and users. Implement privacy controls, role-based access, audit logs, and configurable data retention policies.

